[{"type":"message","user":"U01B7FN0XBK","text":"\u003c@U01B7FN0XBK\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1619741509.024000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"19fecb09-9c8a-4906-834c-307070e2fc44","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"このユースケースはこれで対応、もう一個の方は改良マンボウ関数を作りますわ","ts":"1619740076.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"manbou","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V9/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef093ade-10d3-483e-8e64-44ed714ccf2f","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"カーソル下にMarkdownの画像 ( `![...](...)` )が置かれている場合、そのURLを抽出するScript\n\n```function! Fuga()\n  let [l:line, l:col] = searchpairpos('!\\[[^\\]]*\\](', '', ')', 'bcn')\n  return matchstrpos(getline(l:line), '\\(^!\\[[^\\]]*\\](\\)\\@\u0026lt;=\\([^ )]\\+\\)\\(\\( \\+=\\d\\+x\\d*\\)\\?)\\)\\@=', l:col-1)\nendfunction```","ts":"1619740008.022900","edited":{"user":"UGXMRNBUM","ts":"1619740051.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uGl6n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6767b0f4-2bf0-43e1-a153-202e8df47415","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ちなみに、開始マーカーと終了マーカーが定義できる場合に限っては、searchpairposを使うのがなかなか効率良さそうです","ts":"1619739963.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OMoN2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c862da5-f73f-4841-89a3-855937b3c15b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"やっぱこうなるんですねえ","ts":"1619739821.021400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=qkKe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"432d77f5-805b-48a4-8a7f-e732dffb2220","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"これを元にcol, endも取れるように改良して使ってみます","ts":"1619739782.021000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":fals